# Bat Colony: "create a 1/1 black Bat creature token with flying for each mana
# from a Cave spent to cast it" -- Count$CastTotalManaSpent Cave counts the
# paying mana whose source card is a Cave (AbilityUtils.java:1899-1907). Each
# floating unit records the card that made it (ADR-0042): two Hidden
# Courtyards (Land Cave) and a Plains pay {2}{W}, so two of the three mana
# came from Caves and two Bats are created.
startturn human
advance 3
queue action human manaability 1 0
queue action human manaability 2 0
queue action human tapformana 3 W
queue paygeneric W
queue paygeneric W
queue action human cast 4
passpriority
